    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bashilikale magana adatū kūsolwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ntodo yaho ī dilū ū Yelubaa (hū ū Gidioni) na a bashilikale",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7:1",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Bashilikale:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, banhū, bagosha.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " abo walī nabo bipuuna, būūkakoma ng'hambī bbihī na lwinzī lwa Halodi. Ī ng'hambī ya Bamidiani yalī sukuma yabo kū sī ya ntubīlo, bbihī na kaalūgūlū ka Moole. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Seeba ūng'wīla ū Gidioni, “Ūlī na banhū bingī no, natūdūla kūbatūūla a Bamidiani ū mu makono gabo, a Baisilaeli batizikumīlīja mu kūnidalaha balīhaya gīkī, ‘Nkono gwane ng'wenekīlī gwanipījaga.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū bawīlage a banhū gīkī, ‘Ūyo alīdetema kūlwa boobà ni īngage ū mu lūgūlū lwa Gileadi ashoke.’” Banhū shihūmbī makūmi abīlī na shibīlī būshoka, būsaaga shihūmbī ikūmi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Seeba ūng'wīla ū Gidioni gīkī, “A banhū benaba bataalī bingī no; jaga nabo kūng'wa minzī, nakūkūsolaanhīja kwenūko. Ūlū nūkūwīla gīkī, ‘Ū ng'wenūyū akūja nang'ho,’ ni ajage ū ng'wenūyo; alīyo ūlū nūkūwīla gīkī, ‘Ū ng'wenūyū atūja,’ na ng'hana ū ng'wenūyo ni atizagūja.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'hana ū Gidioni ūbatwaala kūjūng'wa minzī a banhū. Ū Seeba ūng'wīla gīkī, “Abo balayūgang'wa a minzī bo kūgasapula gītī mva īkūzabangīlaga ūkūbatūūla heeke, na a babo balayūtuja mazwi hū baang'wa, nabo ūkūbatūūla heeke.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo bakang'wa a minzī wa kūgaponeja na nkono ū kū nomo bakashika magana adatū. Pye a bangī baatujaga mazwi hū baang'wa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Seeba ūng'wīla ū Gidioni gīkī, “A Bamidiani nakūbatūūla mu nkono gwako mu nzīla ya banhū aba magana adatū benaba, abo baang'wa a minzī bo kūgaponeja ū mu nomo. A bangī bene baje kaya, būlī ng'wene kū ng'wakwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Gidioni ūjisola ī shinje nī mbiilūlū ū kūfuma ū kū banhū a bangī, hūna ūbalaga būja kū maheema gabo; ūsaaja dūhū abo magana adatū. Ī ng'hambī ya Bamidiani yaalī kū ntulumenho, kū sīlīlī yakwe ū Gidioni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gidioni na shilooti sha muna Midiani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū būjikū wenūbo ū Seeba ūng'wīla ū Gidioni gīkī, “Būūkaga ūtulumenhe ū kū ng'hambī yabo, nguno ū nene namalaga kwītūūla mu makono gaako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ūlogoha ū kūja ko, jaga nū ntūmami wako ū Puula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jaaga ūkabadegeleke ūmo baliwīlīla; ūkūpandīka nguzu ja kūja kwīīdumīla ī ng'hambī yenīyo.” Hūna ū Gidioni ūja nū ntūmami wakwe ū Puula, kūshisha begeela a ha bashilikale abo baalī ū kū mhelo mhelo ya ng'hambī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Bamidiani na a Baamaleki, hamò na a banhū bangī a ba kūfuma kīya, baalī biyiita ū mu ntubīlo gwenūyo; bingī no gītī njige. Ī ngamīla jabo jalī ningī no gītī maseni ga ha ng'walo gwa nyanza; yaalī shilambu ū kūjibala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Gidioni aho washika, kwimanīla ūmò wa banhū benabo wandya kūnotoolela ng'wiye shilooti shakwe alīhaya, “Naalootaga shilooti; ū mu shilooti shenīsho naalī naabona ngatī ntaale ng'wibilingu gwa būsu wa būsīga. Gwizaga gūkūpilingitaga kwizīīla a ha ng'hambī ya Bamidiani. Gūūshika gūūlītūla ī liheema na shiligityo shitaale no kūshisha ī liheema lyūdubbūka, lyūkagwa lyūtandagūka na kūtandagūka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wiye ūnshokeja alīhaya, “Bebe ū lwenūlū lūtūdūūma kūbiza lūshū lwa ng'wa Gidioni a hene, ū Ng'wisilaeli ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yoashi? Tambala shilanga ū Mulungu wabatūūlaga mu nkono gwakwe a Bamidiani nī ng'hambī pyī ī yose.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Gidioni aho washiigwa ī shilooti nū būshomheleja waaho, ūnamya Mulungu. Ūshoka ū kū ng'hambī ya Baisilaeli ūbakomiga alībawīla, “Bing'we būkagi! Ū Seeba wītūūlaga mu makono ging'we ī ng'hambī ya Bamidiani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū bakwe ūbatīna būgabanhīka mu magele adatū, hūna ūbagabanhya pye a bose mbiilūlū na shinje jitī na kīnhū ū mu gatī, gwike ū mu gatī jilī na chenge shikūbakaga moto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūbawīla alīhaya, “Nilolagi chiiza, ning'we ng'wīte ūmo nalīītīle ū nene; ūlū nalayeegeele ī ng'hambī nabize naashika ū kū mhelo yaho, ning'we mukwīta ūmo nalīītīle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene na a babo abo balī hamò naane ūlū tūūjifuula ī mbiilūlū jise, na a bing'wee jilījagi ī jing'we; pye a bose ūmo ng'wīpīndīlīgije ī ng'hambī, hama muhamuke na kūhamuka na ilaka lya higūlya mulīhaya, ‘Tūlī ba ng'wa Seeba, na ba ng'wa Gidioni.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūpyenwa kwa Bamidiani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Gidioni na a banhū igana abo walī nabo būshika ū kū mhelo ya ng'hambī ikanza lya lūdīīma lwa ha gatī, a balang'hani ba ng'hambī būsangwa hū bikaabanya lūdīīma dūhū. Ū Gidioni na a biye būjilīja ī mbiilūlū jabo, nī shinje ījo jalī ū mu makono gabo būjibela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a magele būdatū waago gūjilīja ī mbiilūlū, nī shinje ījo jalī ū mu makono gabo būjibela. A bose būshidima kū nkono gwa lūmoso ī chenge, ī mbiilūlū ja kūfuula būjidiimīla nkono gwa būlyo, hūna būhamuka na ilaka itaale balīhaya, “Līīlūshū lya ng'wa Seeba na lya ng'wa Gidioni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bīpīndya pyī ī ng'hambī, na būlī munhū wīmīīla hīgīyī aho waalī; a Bamidiani būhaahūka būyūpelanya sagala, kūnū bakūlīlaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mbiilūlū ījo magana adatū aho jalīla, ū Seeba ūbīīta pye ū mu ng'hambī kwisengagūla shū būlī ng'wene na ng'wiye. Ī libità na būtaale lyūpeela nhambo līlolile Beti-shita kūīlīīla Zeleeda, kūshisha kū lūbīmbī lwa Abeli-mehola bbihī na Tabasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Baisilaeli ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Nafutali, nū lwa ng'wa Asheli, nū lwa ng'wa Manase bitanwa pyī kūbakūūbya a Bamidiani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Gidioni ūtūma nhūng'wa pye a hose ū mu sī ya magūlya ya Efulaimu; ūbawīla, “Nzūgi wangū mubanyame a Bamidiani ū kū minzī ga kū mongo gwa Yolodani, kūshisha Beti-baala.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
